  triage:description "AI3-QA-1 (req-qa, important). AI.3 deliverable #3 moved canonical code/template construction into one dependency-safe module; the repo now has both crates/atm-core/src/error_codes.rs and crates/atm-storage/src/error_codes.rs, but docs/atm-error-codes.md:28 and docs/atm-core/architecture.md:307,676 still describe crates/atm-core/src/error_codes.rs as the single source registry, without acknowledging or pointing at the atm-storage counterpart. Confirmed both files exist on feature/pAI-s3-error-contract-foundation." ;
